B.vG=new A.b8(B.OH,["There is no voice for this language on this device.","Enter the badge code","The 6-digit code is printed on your badge, or ask your first aider. It links this phone to your badge, so only you see your data.","Badge code","Wrong code. Check the code on your badge.","Too many wrong codes. Try again later or ask your first aider.","This phone is no longer linked to your badge. Link it again with the badge code.","Link badge","Read aloud","Stop","HeatGuard","Heat safety for your crew","Today","My health","Emergency","Choose your language","Continue","Back","Skip","Change","Try again","Step {n} of 3","Which crew are you in?","You will see heat safety information for your crew.","Do you have a wearable badge?","Only if your site gave you one. You decide later whether to share its signals.","Heat level now","Live","Offline","Updated {time}","Site time {time}","What to do now","Already in place for your crew","Not feeling well?","Tell the first aider in two taps. You can also report a co-worker.","Select everything you notice.","Serious signs","Other signs","Who is unwell?","Report sent","Settings","Language","Crew","Wearable badge","None","Alerts on this device","Get an alert when the heat level rises or the midday break starts.","Alerts are blocked in this browser. Allow them in the browser settings.","Server address","For example http://192.168.1.20:8000","Save","About","HeatGuard prototype for the Future Health Digital Innovation Challenge. All heat data shown are simulated.","Cannot connect to HeatGuard. Check your connection or the server address.","Loading\u2026","Call 998","UAE ambulance","Could not start the call. Dial 998 on your phone.","Call 998 at once if someone has","While help is coming","Move them to shade or a cool place.","Loosen or remove heavy clothing and PPE.","Cool them with water and fanning. Give water only if they are fully awake.","Stay with them and tell the first aider and your supervisor.","Optional. Sharing your badge signals can warn you earlier when your body is under heat strain.","You have not linked a wearable badge.","Link my badge","Heart rate","Body temperature (estimate)","Badge battery","your limit {v}","Who sees what","Health and safety officer: your values, to check on you.","Supervisor: only that someone needs a check.","Deleted after 2 hours. Never used for discipline.","Heat level has risen","Heat level scale","Demonstration: simulated data"],t.l)
