B.vH=new A.b8(B.Om,["Heat safety","Select your crew","My wearable badge (optional)","I don't have a badge","Conditions are within safe working guidance. Keep drinking water regularly.","It is getting hot. Drink water often and tell your supervisor if you feel unwell.","Heat risk is raised. Take your scheduled rest breaks in the shade and drink water every 15-20 minutes.","High heat risk. Follow the work-rest schedule from your supervisor. Rest in shade or a cool area.","Very high heat risk. Strenuous work should stop. Follow your supervisor's instructions now.","Heat conditions cannot be checked right now. This does NOT mean it is safe. Keep drinking water and take breaks.","Normal","Caution","Raised","High","Very high","Not available","Drink water: about 1 cup every 15-20 minutes","What to do now","Protective actions in place","Work-rest schedule","Emergency - act fast","If a co-worker is confused, collapses or stops sweating: call 998 and the first aider immediately.","Move them to shade, loosen clothing and cool them with water while help comes.","Tell your supervisor about any dizziness, headache, nausea or cramps.","Updated","This screen shows crew-level heat information only. It does not track you.","SIMULATED DATA - DEMONSTRATION ONLY","Cannot reach HeatGuard. Information shown may be out of date - do not assume it is safe.","Midday break: no outdoor work in direct sun from 12:30 to 15:00. Rest in shade or work indoors.","I feel unwell / report a co-worker","What do you notice?","Me","A co-worker","Send to first aider","Help is coming. Rest in the shade, drink water and wait for the first aider.","Call 998 now. Move them to shade and cool them with water. The first aider has been alerted.","Share my wearable signals (optional)","If you agree, your heart rate and estimated body temperature are checked against health limits to warn you earlier. Only the health and safety officer sees your values; your supervisor only sees that someone needs a check. Signals are deleted after 2 hours, never used for discipline, and you can stop at any time.","My age group","I agree to share","Stop sharing and delete my data","You are sharing your signals.","You are not sharing your signals.","My heart rate","Your signals look normal.","Your signals show heat strain. Stop, rest in the shade and drink water. Your first aider has been told.","Notify me on this phone","Draft translation - waiting for review by native speakers.","Dizziness","Headache","Nausea or vomiting","Muscle cramps","Heavy sweating","Unusual tiredness","Confusion or slurred speech","Fainting or collapse","Hot, dry skin or stopped sweating","Seizure"],t.l)
